<title>USA: New York timecharter fixtures - Sept 10.</title>
<headline>New York timecharter fixtures - Sept 10.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pamphilos (built 1977) 60,866 dwt del off Jamaica 20-30/9 redel Black Sea $7,000 daily plus $120,000 bb Frapaco.</p>
<p>Tetien (built 1984) 40,045 dwt del Manila 25/9-5/10 one year trading $7,700 daily Choyang.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk 212 859-1640</p>
</text>
